      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## WEBCON observability stack\n\nMetrics, traces and logs from the WEBCON **Portal** and **Service**, plus **SQL Server** and **Windows** metrics. Tiles below: WEBCON status for the last 30 minutes (\uD83D\uDFE2 OK · \uD83D\uDFE1 warning · \uD83D\uDD34 problem). Click a tile to see the details.\n\n| Dashboard | When to open |\n|---|---|\n| [**WEBCON – Performance**](/d/webcon-performance) | slow Portal, form or path transition – **where** WEBCON loses time (rules, data sources, actions, SQL, Service) |\n| [**WEBCON – Operations**](/d/webcon-operations) | weekly overview: top 10 actions and paths, user tasks, external API errors |\n| [**SQL Server – WEBCON**](/d/sqlserver-webcon) | whether the database is the bottleneck (waits, locks, I/O, memory) |\n| [**Windows – Host load**](/d/windows-host) | server CPU, memory, disks, processes |\n| [**WEBCON – Availability and backlog**](/d/webcon-availability) | whether the Portal responds (health, certificate) and whether the database backlog is growing: timeouts, cyclical actions, emails |\n| [**Alerts**](/alerting/list) | alert rules and their state |\n\n**First time?** [Grafana in 10 minutes]({{DOCS_URL}}/docs/user-guide/01-grafana-in-10-minutes.md) · [Scenarios: from symptom to cause]({{DOCS_URL}}/docs/user-guide/08-scenarios.md) · [Concepts (p95, trace, span)]({{DOCS_URL}}/docs/user-guide/02-concepts.md) · [All documentation]({{DOCS_URL}}/docs/README.md)\n\n<small>Unofficial project – not a WEBCON product; no support or warranty (MIT license).</small>"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Portal HTTP p95",
      "description": "95th percentile of Portal response time (excluding health check), range = chart interval.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"Portal\",http_route!~\"/?health.*\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "interval": "1m"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2,
          "noValue": "no traffic"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "fields": "",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      },
      "links": [
        {
          "title": "WEBCON – Performance",
          "url": "/d/webcon-performance?${__url_time_range}"
        }
      ]
    },
